{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.2021b.q11.material.recovered", "text": "在“信息编码”第一课时的课堂总结环节，老师给学生出示如图7所示思维导图。结合思维导图，孙老师对本节课主要的信息编码进行了简要梳理和总结，接着又给出课后思考题如下：①说一说日常生活中应用信息编码的实例。②我们电脑或手机中的文字、图片、音频和视频也是通过信息编码进行存储的，你知道这是怎么实现的吗？最后，孙老师结语：“我们生活中，信息编码无处不在，同学们要用心观察，善于发现。下一节课我们将学习如何利用计算机进行信息编码。”", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "aa6714d6a766f4f1493994f762c55aa4c353dbef069c5b6a66c81d9cdf1feb3d", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2070, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2280, "next_source_question_number": 19, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 11, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "aa6714d6a766f4f1493994f762c55aa4c353dbef069c5b6a66c81d9cdf1feb3d"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.2021b.q11"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.s1.k01", "ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.s1.k02", "ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.s1.k08"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.315.r001"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.2021b.q11"], "word_count": 210, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "xinxi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "aa6714d6a766f4f1493994f762c55aa4c353dbef069c5b6a66c81d9cdf1feb3d", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2070, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2280, "next_source_question_number": 19, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 11, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "aa6714d6a766f4f14