{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.2021b.q12.material.recovered", "text": "陈老师设计了主题为“我就是我，是不一样烟火”的学习项目。此项目是学生根据表达需求，综合运用信息处理的知识与技能，通过经历需求分析、内容选取、作品创作、美化修改等问题解决过程，形成自我介绍的多媒体作品。基于这一主题作品的评价表设计如表2所示。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "aa6714d6a766f4f1493994f762c55aa4c353dbef069c5b6a66c81d9cdf1feb3d", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2341, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2461, "next_source_question_number": 20, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 12, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "aa6714d6a766f4f1493994f762c55aa4c353dbef069c5b6a66c81d9cdf1feb3d"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.2021b.q12"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.s1.k08", "ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.s3.k03", "ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.s3.k04"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.315.r001", "ntce.outline.315.r022", "ntce.outline.315.r023", "ntce.outline.315.r024", "ntce.outline.315.r025", "ntce.outline.315.r032"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.2021b.q12"], "word_count": 120, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "xinxi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "aa6714d6a766f4f1493994f762c55aa4c353dbef069c5b6a66c81d9cdf1feb3d", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2341, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2461, "next_source_question_number": 20, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 12, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "aa6714d6a766f4f1493994f762c55aa4c353dbef069c5b6a66c81d9cdf1feb3d"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authorization_status": "unknown", "holder": null, "use_scope": "research_non_commercial", "expires_at": null, "source_nature": "official_exam", "nature_note": "教育主管部门公开发布的考试试题", "nature_evidence": "filename_pattern:官方真题命名", "attribution_required": false}}}
{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.2021b.q13.material.recovered", "text": "电子信息媒体中广泛应用遮罩动画增效果。学生在理解了遮罩动画的制作原理后能够以更加灵活多样的方式表达自己想要传达的信息。遮罩动画这节课涉及到的知识点主要有：遮罩动画原理、遮罩动画的主要作用和应用场景，遮罩动画的制作方法。刘老师在教授动画这一单元的内容时，围绕“诗画中国”的主题，在主题中融合了中国传统文化中的诗画内容。本节课中刘老师设计了一个通过“探照灯”的移动展现黄公望的“富春山居图”的动画实例，通过这个实例引导学生经历“动画效果分析——制作步骤设计——动画制作——运行调试”的过程。并讲解了遮罩动画的原理，遮罩动画分层思想以及遮罩动画的制作方法，为了讲解清晰，刘老师还绘制了一个简要的遮罩动画原理示意图来进行说明。由于学生的基础存在差异，在接下来的布置任务环节刘老师希望能够为学生提供不同的任务，第一个任务增加一点难度，并融合之前学习的一些动画制作技术共同完成动画效果；第二个任务则给予学有余力的学生更大的创作空间，给学生个性化表达的机会。教学目标：①能描述遮罩动画的作用，知道其应用的场景；②能叙述遮罩动画的原理，分辨出遮罩动画中遮罩层与被遮罩层，领会动画中的分层思想；③经历“动画效果分析——制作步骤设计——动画制作——运行调试”的过程，学会遮罩动画的制作方法。教学对象：初中一年级学生，已经学习过逐帧动画、动作补间动画和形状补间动画。教学方法：任务驱动法。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "aa6714d6a766f4f1493994f762c55aa4c353dbef069c5b6a66c81d9cdf1feb3d", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2577, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3160, "next_source_question_number": 21, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 13, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "aa6714d6a766f4f1493994f762c55aa4c353dbef069c5b6a66c81d9cdf1feb3d"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.2021b.q13"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.s2.k02", "ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.s3.k02", "ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.315.r007", "ntce.outline.315.r008", "ntce.outline.315.r016", "ntce.outline.315.r017", "ntce.outline.315.r018", "ntce.outline.315.r020", "ntce.outline.315.r023", "ntce.outline.315.r024", "ntce.outline.315.r025"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.2021b.q13"], "word_count": 583, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "xinxi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "aa6714d6a766f4f1493994f762c55aa4c353dbef069c5b6a66c81d9cdf1feb3d", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2577, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3160, "next_source_question_number": 21, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 13, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "aa6714d6a766f4f1493994f762c55aa4c353dbef069c5b6a66c81d9cdf1feb3d"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authorization_status": "unknown", "holder": null, "use_scope": "research_non_commercial", "expires_at": null, "source_nature": "official_exam", "nature_note": "教育主管部门公开发布的考试试题", "nature_evidence": "filename_pattern:官方真题命名", "attribution_required": false}}}
